## Process

1. Analyze the PBT: identify functions, types, assertions, and strategies
2. Implement functions in Impl.lean using `write_lean_impl`
3. Validate with `lean_diagnostic_messages` — fix errors until it compiles
4. Write theorem statements in Spec.lean using `write_lean_spec`
5. Validate with `lean_diagnostic_messages` — fix errors until it compiles
6. Ensure Impl.lean has zero sorry and Spec.lean has theorem statements
